{"type":"message","id":"2e3b025f","parentId":"c6074dce","timestamp":"2026-01-31T14:40:33.583Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Run Sasha's daily job scan. Read /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/search-config.json for search parameters and /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/resume.md for her CV.\n\nSearch for matching clinical ops, regulatory affairs, research manager roles. Location: Baltimore 30mi + remote. Salary floor: 85K+.\n\nIMPORTANT: Use LinkedIn job links (linkedin.com/jobs/view/...) as the PRIMARY link source for all listings. Do NOT use direct career page links (jobs.jhu.edu, workday, etc.) as they go stale and redirect. If you find a job on a career page, search for the same posting on LinkedIn and use that link instead.\n\nGenerate report following the template in /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/templates/daily-report.md. Save report to /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/sasha-job-search/reports/2026-01-31.md. Send the full formatted report as output."}],"timestamp":1769870433582}}
