{"type":"message","id":"907ecca0","parentId":"cf7caf61","timestamp":"2026-01-31T14:40:37.227Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_013g5MY4i8p8dTmHyx8zkKxi","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"candidate\": {\n    \"name\": \"Sasha Greenspan, PhD\",\n    \"email\": \"sasha.greenspan@gmail.com\",\n    \"location\": \"Baltimore, MD\",\n    \"resumeFile\": \"Sasha_Greenspan_Resume_010326\",\n    \"resumeDate\": \"2026-01-03\",\n    \"summary\": \"Research operations leader with 20+ years building and scaling complex clinical and biological research programs. PhD Biology, deep experience in device-enabled clinical studies, GCP/ICH compliance, REDCap, IRB submissions, team leadership. Currently Program Admin at Kennedy Krieger Institute / Johns Hopkins University.\"\n  },\n  \"search\": {\n    \"keywords\": [\n      \"Clinical Operations Support\",\n      \"Clinical Project Assistant\",\n      \"Clinical Project Specialist\",\n      \"Learning and Development\",\n      \"Regulatory Specialist\",\n      \"Regulatory Affairs\",\n      \"Research Manager\",\n      \"Hospital Administration\"\n    ],\n    \"jobTitles\": [\n      \"Clinical Trial Manager\",\n      \"Regulatory Specialist\",\n      \"Research Manager\",\n      \"Clinical Operations Lead\",\n      \"Hospital Administrator\",\n      \"Administrator\"\n    ],\n    \"location\": {\n      \"base\": \"Baltimore, MD\",\n      \"radiusMiles\": 30,\n      \"remote\": true,\n      \"hybrid\": true\n    },\n    \"salary\": {\n      \"floor\": 85000,\n      \"ceiling\": null,\n      \"note\": \"No ceiling — sky's the limit 🚀\"\n    },\n    \"dealbreakers\": [\n      \"Travel required\",\n      \"Requires 5+ years CRO experience (she doesn't have this)\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"companies\": {\n    \"specific\": [\n      \"Headlands Research\",\n      \"Pharmaron\",\n      \"Axon\",\n      \"AstraZeneca\",\n      \"Johns Hopkins University\",\n      \"University of Maryland\",\n      \"University of Maryland Baltimore\",\n      \"Takeda\",\n      \"BeOne\",\n      \"Katalyst CRO\",\n      \"RTI International\",\n      \"FHI Clinical\",\n      \"Population Council\",\n      \"Emergent BioSolutions\",\n      \"Rho Inc\",\n      \"BioLink 360\",\n      \"CareFirst\",\n      \"McLaughlin Research Institute\",\n      \"EmVenio\",\n      \"Intralytix\",\n      \"Ascension\",\n      \"Kymera Therapeutics\",\n      \"Boeson Research\",\n      \"Alliance Clinical Network\",\n      \"Velocity Clinical Research\",\n      \"Vertex\",\n      \"Medtronic\",\n      \"Gilead Sciences\",\n      \"Philips\",\n      \"Regeneron\",\n      \"Amgen\",\n      \"Precision for Medicine\",\n      \"Geneva Foundation\",\n      \"Nordberg Medical\",\n      \"Paradigm Health\"\n    ],\n    \"general\": [\n      \"Pharma\",\n      \"Biotech\",\n      \"Hospital\",\n      \"Health Tech\",\n      \"Research Institutes\",\n      \"Universities\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"report\": {\n    \"deliverTo\": \"Doug via Telegram\",\n    \"tone\": \"casual/friendly\",\n    \"groupBy\": \"company\",\n    \"scope\": \"comprehensive\",\n    \"frequency\": \"daily\",\n    \"time\": \"6:00 AM ET\",\n    \"includeIfEmpty\": true\n  },\n  \"tracking\": {\n    \"previouslyFound\": [],\n    \"removedJobs\": [],\n    \"companiesSearched\": [],\n    \"lastScanDate\": null\n  }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1769870437226}}
{"type":"message","id":"ddbbffcd","parentId":"907ecca0","timestamp":"2026-01-31T14:40:37.232Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01BLUdUgQUFTwZkBk3PWeBFd","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Sasha Greenspan, PhD\n\n352-575-8605 | sasha.greenspan@gmail.com | LinkedIn | Google Scholar | Baltimore, MD\n\n## SUMMARY\nResearch operations leader with 20+ years building and scaling complex clinical and biological research programs. Deep experience leading end-to-end, device-enabled clinical studies (start-up through close-out), coordinating sites and vendors, and overseeing GCP/ICH-compliant workflows. Known for translating regulatory and technical complexity into efficient, patient-centered execution that drives enrollment, retention, and data quality.\n\n## CLINICAL RESEARCH EXPERIENCE\n\n### Supervisory Research Administrative Coordinator (2022–2025)\n*Clinical Project Manager-equivalent | Regulatory Specialist-equivalent*\n**Pediatric Neuroimaging Core, Marcus Autism Center, School of Medicine, Emory University** — Atlanta, GA\n\n- Led end-to-end operations for multimillion-dollar, device-enabled clinical studies, serving as primary operational and regulatory owner across sites, vendors, data, and study teams\n- Study lifecycle management: Built REDCap databases; prepared regulatory start-up packages; activated new research sites; coordinated vendors for imaging hardware, wearables, and data systems; managed timelines, budgets, and milestones; conducted monthly data audits; coordinated cross-functional teams; proactively mitigated operational and regulatory risks; Led regulatory close-out, data reconciliation, and reporting\n- Regulatory leadership: Led IRB submissions, amendments, and continuing reviews; maintained regulatory binders; interpreted and applied regulatory codes to ensure ICH-GCP and FDA compliance\n- Team leadership: Onboarded study staff; designed and delivered GCP/ICH and protocol training; authored SOPs, study manuals, and scripts to standardize site practices; supported staff performance and retention\n- Impact: Tripled enrollment for hard-to-reach populations and achieved the highest participation of historically underrepresented groups in the program's history\n\n## ADDITIONAL OPERATIONS & PROGRAM LEADERSHIP\n\n### Program Administrator (2024–present)\n**Dr. James A. Ferguson EID RISE Graduate Research Fellowship**\n*Center for Excellence in Public Health Leadership, Kennedy Krieger Institute* — Baltimore, MD\n*Joint faculty appointment: Assistant Scientist, Dept of Molecular Microbiology and Immunology, Bloomberg School of Public Health, Johns Hopkins University*\n\n- Lead strategic planning, recruitment, training, and engagement (100+ annual events) for nationwide public health workforce pipeline supporting 40+ graduate infectious disease research fellows annually\n\n### Operations Lead & Co-founder (2019–2025)\n**Student Network for Amphibian Pathogen Surveillance (SNAPS)** — Remote\n\n- Scaled network from 0 to 1,250+ student participants across 50+ institutions in 33 states\n- Built data collection, communication, and training infrastructure for distributed research execution\n\n### Research Associate | Postdoctoral Scientist (2018–2022)\n**Becker Lab, Department of Biological Sciences, University of Alabama** — Tuscaloosa, AL\n\n- Led international, multi-site emerging infectious disease field research program and molecular analysis pipeline\n- Managed buildout of two molecular labs (budgets, vendor contracts, procurement, training, compliance)\n- Co-managed $1M+ in federal funding; developed budgets, wrote grants (2 NSF awards), and forecasted spend\n- Mentored and facilitated research & publication output of 8 graduate students; authored 17 papers\n\n### Research Ecologist (2005–2014)\n**UGA Marine Institute | Jones Center at Ichauway | La Selva Biological Station | National Park Service** — Various locations\n\n- Implemented multi-site global change research, wildlife infectious disease surveillance, and conservation efforts\n\n## EDUCATION\n- **PhD cum laude**, Biology, James Cook University (2014–2018)\n- **MS**, Biology, University of Maine (2010–2011)\n- **BA**, Environmental Science & Anthropology, Wesleyan University (2002–2006)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1769870437231}}
{"type":"message","id":"98285874","parentId":"ddbbffcd","timestamp":"2026-01-31T14:40:37.234Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_017upgtym9yUpU5vhAPzAMQ4","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Daily Report Template — Sasha's Job Radar\n\n## Format\n\n```\n☀️ Sasha's Job Radar — [DATE]\n\nHey Sasha! Here's what's out there today 👀\n\n⚙️ Search Settings\n📄 Resume: [RESUME_FILE]\n🔑 Keywords: [KEYWORD_LIST]\n📍 Remote (US) + Hybrid within 30mi of Baltimore\n💰 Minimum: $85k+\n\n📊 Today's Scan\n🔍 Scanned: [N] companies + boards | 🆕 New: [N] postings | ✅ Verified Live: [N] | ❌ Stale/Removed: [N]\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏢 [COMPANY NAME] — [Location]\n\n[#]️⃣ [Job Title] [🔥 if strong match]\n💰 [Salary or \"Not listed\"] | 📅 [X days ago]\n[2-3 line summary of responsibilities/requirements]\n🏷️ **matching keyword** · non-matching · **matching** · non-matching\n🔗 [Apply link — browser verified]\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🆕 New Company Spotlight\n[COMPANY NAME] — [Location]\n[2-3 line company profile — size, focus area, why relevant]\n\n📉 Removed Since Yesterday\n[Job Title] (Company) — expired/filled\n\n📭 No new postings from: [company list]\n\nAll links browser-verified ✅ | Scanned [DATE/TIME]\n```\n\n## Rules\n- All links MUST be browser-verified before inclusion\n- Dead links are REMOVED, never shared\n- Posted dates on EVERY listing (consistent format: \"📅 X days ago\")\n- Keywords matching Sasha's profile are **bolded** in tags\n- Group by company\n- If no new jobs found, still send report showing companies searched\n- Salary floor $85K+ — no upper limit\n- Flag CRO experience requirements (dealbreaker)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1769870437233}}
